WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.133
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:02.133 --> 00:00:04.901
As you know, March Madness
kicks off next week.

00:00:04.901 --> 00:00:07.634
This is where we find out who
the best college basketball team

00:00:07.634 --> 00:00:08.968
in the country is.

00:00:08.968 --> 00:00:11.934
But over on our sister station,
the Steel Network,

00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:13.334
they're doing something
a little different.

00:00:13.334 --> 00:00:14.801
They have a tournament
to find out

00:00:14.801 --> 00:00:17.901
who the best college basketball
mascot is.

00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:20.601
It's called March Madness
Mascot Mayhem.

00:00:20.601 --> 00:00:21.634
It's pretty intense.

00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:22.968
And, actually,
it's on right now.

00:00:22.968 --> 00:00:25.334
If I could just switch
the channel -- check this out.

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:27.267
♪♪

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:29.400
&gt;&gt; The Steel Network presents

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.100
"March Madness Mascot Mayhem!"

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.934
Whoo!

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:37.300
-Yeah! Welcome to March Madness
Mascot Mayhem.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.534
I'm Skeeter Ramsay,
and I'm joined by my partner,

00:00:39.534 --> 00:00:40.868
Pat Lefritz.

00:00:40.868 --> 00:00:43.400
Pat, we've got a competition
for the ages tonight.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.067
-Well, that's right, Skeeter.

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:48.434
Yeah, w-we're down
to the final four mascots...

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:51.100
-Cuatro left.
-...in this year's tournament.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.167
And the mayhem's about to begin.

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:56.300
-Well, it certainly is.
Now, let's meet the mascots.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:58.968
Representing Duke University,

00:00:58.968 --> 00:01:01.334
it's the Blue Devil.

00:01:01.334 --> 00:01:04.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:04.334 --> 00:01:07.868
♪♪

00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:11.167
-From the University
of North Carolina,

00:01:11.167 --> 00:01:14.968
it's Rameses!
-Oh, wow!

00:01:14.968 --> 00:01:17.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:17.968 --> 00:01:20.400
♪♪

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.467
From the University of Miami,

00:01:22.467 --> 00:01:25.334
give it up for Sebastian!

00:01:25.334 --> 00:01:28.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:30.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:32.801
-And last but not least,

00:01:32.801 --> 00:01:34.868
it's the pride of Virginia Tech.

00:01:34.868 --> 00:01:37.501
Ladies and gentlemen,
the HokieBird.

00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:40.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:40.501 --> 00:01:43.901
♪♪

00:01:43.901 --> 00:01:45.634
-All right.

00:01:45.634 --> 00:01:48.467
That's right, you can feel
the excitement in the air, Pat.

00:01:48.467 --> 00:01:51.067
You've got four equally-talented
mascots out there,

00:01:51.067 --> 00:01:52.467
but only one will survive.

00:01:52.467 --> 00:01:53.868
What are the keys to the game?

00:01:53.868 --> 00:01:56.067
-Well, it's going to be
a real nail-biter, Skeeter.

00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:57.901
But the mascots have heart.

00:01:57.901 --> 00:01:59.601
They've got determination.

00:01:59.601 --> 00:02:02.400
You know, one of them
even has a cape. [ Laughs ]

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:05.868
In the end, it's all going to
come down to who wants it more.

00:02:05.868 --> 00:02:07.300
-And we're about to find out.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:10.200
Let's get this party started.

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:11.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:11.434 --> 00:02:13.634
-Round one -- flip cup.

00:02:13.634 --> 00:02:16.234
-Whoo! Facing off in flip cup,

00:02:16.234 --> 00:02:19.100
we've got Rameses
versus the Blue Devil.

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:22.501
The first to flip three cups
wins.

00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:25.734
On your mark, get set, go.

00:02:25.734 --> 00:02:27.200
[ Whistle ]

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:31.033
-There's no love lost between
these two bitter rivals, Pat.

00:02:31.033 --> 00:02:32.200
[ Bell dings ]

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:33.734
Oh, we've got a winner
right there already!

00:02:33.734 --> 00:02:34.968
Oh, my goodness.
-Wow!

00:02:34.968 --> 00:02:36.601
-Right there's our winner.
-Wow!

00:02:36.601 --> 00:02:38.367
-The Blue Devil.

00:02:38.367 --> 00:02:40.234
The Blue Devil moves on.

00:02:40.234 --> 00:02:42.300
-Duke takes!
-Congratulations, Blue Devil.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.667
-And now it's time to find out

00:02:44.667 --> 00:02:46.701
who you'll be facing off
against.

00:02:46.701 --> 00:02:48.968
It's time for round two.

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:51.300
-Round two -- dunk contest.

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:54.467
-Whoo! Now, this is
the mascot dunk contest,

00:02:54.467 --> 00:02:57.367
with Sebastian going up
against the HokieBird.

00:02:57.367 --> 00:02:58.601
The rules are simple.

00:02:58.601 --> 00:03:01.501
You each get one dunk,
and the best dunk wins.

00:03:01.501 --> 00:03:06.100
-And remember, you'll all be
judged in three areas --

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:10.601
technical precision, difficulty
level, and most importantly,

00:03:10.601 --> 00:03:12.701
pizzazz.
-That's right.

00:03:12.701 --> 00:03:14.934
Sebastian, you're up first.

00:03:14.934 --> 00:03:16.167
Don't be nervous.

00:03:16.167 --> 00:03:18.467
Let's see if you've got
some dunk in your trunk.

00:03:18.467 --> 00:03:21.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:23.334
[ Whistle ]

00:03:23.334 --> 00:03:25.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:25.033 --> 00:03:28.000
-Outrageous!

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:31.400
-Can we see that -- Can we see
that again in slow motion?

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:34.667
He goes up for the air,
he gets a little air, and bang.

00:03:34.667 --> 00:03:36.434
And then watch what he does
after this.

00:03:36.434 --> 00:03:37.634
This is kind of exciting.

00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:39.901
Hey-yo.

00:03:39.901 --> 00:03:40.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:40.968 --> 00:03:42.267
That's a photo flip
right there.

00:03:42.267 --> 00:03:44.234
-Wow.
-All right.

00:03:44.234 --> 00:03:46.467
It is your turn, HokieBird.

00:03:46.467 --> 00:03:48.434
Fly, turkey, fly.

00:03:48.434 --> 00:03:51.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:51.434 --> 00:03:56.701
♪♪

00:03:56.701 --> 00:03:58.033
[ Audience ohs ]

00:03:58.033 --> 00:04:02.100
-Well, I think it -- I think
it goes without saying.

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:04.601
The winner is Sebastian
with the dunk.

00:04:04.601 --> 00:04:07.601
[ Bell dinging,
cheers and applause ]

00:04:07.601 --> 00:04:10.167
Yeah, it all comes down to this.

00:04:10.167 --> 00:04:13.100
It's time for the final round.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.400
-Final round -- dance off!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:18.200
-Whoo!
-Our two finalists are --

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.734
the Blue Devil.

00:04:19.734 --> 00:04:20.734
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Yes.

00:04:20.734 --> 00:04:22.434
-Sebastian.
-That's correct.

00:04:22.434 --> 00:04:26.434
And may --
may the best mascot win.

00:04:26.434 --> 00:04:28.334
And may I also remind you
that pride

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:30.667
is on the line, so bring it.

00:04:30.667 --> 00:04:32.834
First up,
we have the Blue Devil.

00:04:32.834 --> 00:04:34.067
Whenever you're ready.

00:04:34.067 --> 00:04:36.334
♪♪

00:04:36.334 --> 00:04:39.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:39.334 --> 00:04:43.400
♪♪

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.767
-He's really leaving it all
out there, Skeeter!

00:04:45.767 --> 00:04:47.300
-I've never seen anything
like it.

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.701
He's tearing up the floor.

00:04:48.701 --> 00:04:50.834
Look at that --
-He's become one with the music.

00:04:50.834 --> 00:04:52.767
-Yeah, a really great job.

00:04:52.767 --> 00:04:54.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:54.734 --> 00:04:56.834
Blue Devil went for it
right there.

00:04:56.834 --> 00:04:59.067
A master class in body movement.

00:04:59.067 --> 00:05:00.467
What did you think, Pat?

00:05:00.467 --> 00:05:02.234
-Outrageous!

00:05:02.234 --> 00:05:04.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:04.367 --> 00:05:06.234
-All right.

00:05:06.234 --> 00:05:10.934
Sebastian --
Sebastian, you're up.

00:05:10.934 --> 00:05:13.734
Let's see what you can do.

00:05:13.734 --> 00:05:16.868
♪♪

00:05:16.868 --> 00:05:19.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:19.868 --> 00:05:25.467
♪♪

00:05:25.467 --> 00:05:31.033
♪♪

00:05:31.033 --> 00:05:34.167
Whoa! I've never seen --

00:05:34.167 --> 00:05:35.801
I've never seen anything
like that,

00:05:35.801 --> 00:05:38.367
and I've snowboarded down
Mt. Everest in the nude.

00:05:38.367 --> 00:05:40.000
Amazing moves out there.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.167
What did you think, Pat?

00:05:41.167 --> 00:05:43.934
-Outrageous!
-All right, yeah, exactly.

00:05:43.934 --> 00:05:48.100
Pat, it is time to find out who
this year's champion will be.

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:50.300
The winner will be decided
by audience applause.

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:51.868
Is it the Blue Devil?

00:05:51.868 --> 00:05:54.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:54.501 --> 00:05:56.434
Or is it Sebastian?

00:05:56.434 --> 00:05:58.300
[ Louder cheers and applause ]

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:01.067
The winner is Sebastian!

00:06:01.067 --> 00:06:03.200
[ Bell dinging ]

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:04.801
Congratulations.

00:06:04.801 --> 00:06:06.834
Great job, Sebastian.

00:06:06.834 --> 00:06:07.834
Congratulations.

00:06:07.834 --> 00:06:09.534
Thank you to all of our mascots.

00:06:09.534 --> 00:06:12.033
Look for them in this year's
March Madness tournament.

00:06:12.033 --> 00:06:14.434
We'll be right back with more
"tonight show" everybody.

00:06:14.434 --> 00:06:16.067
Come on back!

00:06:16.067 --> 00:06:19.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:23.634
♪♪

